@base = http://localhost:8080
@accountId = 1
@loanId = 12
@policyVersion = 1

### 预置账号
GET {{base}}/api/accounts

### 浏览；分页从零开始
GET {{base}}/api/books?keyword=Java&page=0&size=6

### 详情
GET {{base}}/api/books/14

### 借阅；将响应 id 更新为上面的 loanId
POST {{base}}/api/loans
Content-Type: application/json
X-Library-Account-Id: {{accountId}}

{"bookId":14}

### 当前借阅
GET {{base}}/api/loans/current?page=0&size=20
X-Library-Account-Id: {{accountId}}

### 归还；重复执行不会再次释放数量
POST {{base}}/api/loans/{{loanId}}/return
X-Library-Account-Id: {{accountId}}

### 管理查询
GET {{base}}/api/admin/loans?scope=OVERDUE&page=0&size=20

### 查询规则；将响应 version 更新为 policyVersion
GET {{base}}/api/borrowing-policy

### 修改规则；版本过旧返回409
PUT {{base}}/api/admin/borrowing-policy
Content-Type: application/json

{"maxActiveLoans":10,"loanDays":15,"expectedVersion":{{policyVersion}}}

### 数据库与锁健康
GET {{base}}/actuator/health

### 读取就绪，不受Redis故障影响
GET {{base}}/actuator/health/readiness
